[{"id": 44414511, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "CAROUSEL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44341524, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": [{"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "imageUrl": null, "fileIdentifier": null, "textEditorState": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\">The tree blew down.</p>", "labelEditorState": null}, {"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "imageUrl": null, "fileIdentifier": null, "textEditorState": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\">Grandma shouted.</p>", "labelEditorState": null}, {"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "imageUrl": null, "fileIdentifier": null, "textEditorState": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\">It exploded.</p>", "labelEditorState": null}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{\"text\":[{\"text\":\"The tree blew down.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"Grandma shouted.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"It exploded.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"}]}", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44413899, "text": "<h2>The Activity:</h2>\nLook at the three short sentences below (in the orange box). For each sentence:\n<ol>\n<li>Choose three adverbials:\n<ul> \n<li>Time (when it happened);</li>\n<li>Place (where it happened);</li>\n<li>Cause (why it happened). </li>\n</ul></li>\n<li>Say the sentence with each adverbial at the start of the sentence and again with it at the end of the sentence. Which do you prefer? Why? Is it the same with every sentence?</li>\n<li>Choose your favourite adverbial and write down both versions of the sentence. Remember to use a comma after the adverbial when it is at the start of the sentence.</li>\n</ol>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44341524, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44415757, "text": "Example Sentence with Adverbials", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 44414668, "text": "Orange box, as in the activity, displaying the sentence, 'I ate my lunch'.", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 117, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "1638353484009_1image1-01FNTQKG30WTAAK8ENX8WVX8G0.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44415714, "text": "Written on lined paper: 'I ate my lunch before the lion could get it. Before the lion could get it, I ate my lunch.'", "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 117, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "1638354438603_1image1-01FNTRGK5CMD7JVN7CZ6Z2MBPP.jpeg", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44414874, "text": "<h2>1. Choose Your Adverbials:</h2>\nChoose three adverbials that fit with the sentence:\n<ul>\n<li><b>Time</b>: <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">at midday</span></li>\n<li><b>Place</b>: <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">in the boiling hot school hall</span></li>\n<li><b>Cause</b>: <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">before the lion could get it</span></li>\n</ul>\n<br></br>\n<h2>2. Say the Sentences:</h2>\nSay the sentence with each adverbial at the start and end. For each adverbial, say whether you prefer it at the start or end.\n<br></br>\n<b>Time:</b>\n<br> I ate my lunch <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">at midday</span>. \n<br><span style=\"color:#F28D00\">At midday</span>, I ate my lunch.\n<br><i>I prefer the second sentence because it sounds like I was doing some other things before and then stopped to eat lunch.</i>\n<br></br>\n<b>Place:</b>\n<br> I ate my lunch <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">in the boiling hot school hall</span>. \n<br><span style=\"color:#F28D00\">In the boiling hot school hall</span>, I ate my lunch.\n<br><i>I prefer the first sentence because when the adverbial is at the start of the sentence, it takes forever to get to what was actually happening, which I found a bit confusing.</i>\n<br></br>\n<b>Cause:</b>\n<br>I ate my lunch <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">before the lion could get it</span>. \n<br><span style=\"color:#F28D00\">Before the lion could get it</span>, I ate my lunch.\n<br><i>I prefer the second sentence because I imagine a lion about to pounce on something first, and then it’s kind of funny that the lion is trying to get some lunch rather than prey.</i>\n<br></br>\n<h2>3. Write Two Sentences:</h2>\nChoose your favourite adverbial and write down both versions of the sentence.", "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 117, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 117, "name": "Example Sentence with Adverbials", "logCreatedAt": "2021-12-01T10:10:43.7129", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-12-01T10:10:43.7129", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44341524, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 117, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44413344, "text": "Adverbials can be use to show time (when it happened), place (where it happened) and cause (why it happened). They can be one word or several words working together. \n<br></br>\nHere are some examples:\n<ul>\n<li><b>Time</b>: I went to the shop<span style=\"color:#F28D00\"> at two o'clock</span>.</li>\n<li><b>Place</b>: <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">Inside</span>, it was much warmer.</li>\n<li><b>Cause</b>: The train was cancelled <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">because of the wind</span>.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 44341524, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"heigh